    - target: {fileID: 7219740182294244516, guid: 4d5599c0cf0150643a5ca729d9ce78f1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Hi Cahar! \nTo turn off this message go into ALLUI_Canvas and disable
        the \"Other Notes Pannel\" Game Object.\n\nI did a little reorganizing and
        clean up of my mess from the other scenes I was working from and brought
        in your version of the character controller from your work in Test Area 3,
        I really love how smooth that felt to use.\n\nAll Script references should
        be correctly setup, but if not please do let me know and I'll make updates
        for you or if its simple i'll tell you how to do it quick.\n\nAll bosses
        use the Boss Display Canvas Object, so I recommend only having one boss active
        at a time and use the FightTriggers to turn the boss fight on when you walk
        into a specific area."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7219740182294244516, guid: 4d5599c0cf0150643a5ca729d9ce78f1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_margin.w
